# Regenerable pipeline artifacts — same set as .gitignore. These are staged URL lists, shard/chunk
# splits and harvest dumps: build/staging output, never runtime inputs. *.jsonl above already caught
# the harvest dumps, but the .txt lists and the extension-less chunk splits were not covered, so the
# build context was still ~4.9GB and the deploy upload stalled indefinitely.
monitor-bio-urls.txt
monitor-misses.txt
live-candidates-full.txt
mbu-chunk-*
mmiss-chunk-*
mbu-sample.txt
live-shard-*
live-rr-*.txt
